    50 cursed scrolls of amnesia,  crystal ball with 50 charges,
    blindfold, helm of telepathy, boots of water walking, wand of
    teleportation with 127 charges, wand of enlightenment.
  Put everyting but the want in the bag, drop the bag, and suicide on
    the stairs, forcing bones.
Start the seed player.
  Pick up bag, wear armor, helm, ring, and boots.
  Read  blessed scroll, don't teleport.
  Put on blindfold.
  Until mines found:
    read cursed scroll to drop level
    sometimes quaff gain level potion
    use crystal ball to find downstairs
    If there's two,
      go into mines 
      read a few scrolls of amnesia
      go to minetown one level at a time, sometimes quaffing 
        (and further if appropriate by role)
    If one stairs
      read to go down.
  Until Oracle found
    Continue down, sometimes quaffing
  Once found, 
