       luck)
      go to bottom of the mines if not already done, then amesiate a bit
       more 
  Continue descending a level at a time, sometimes quaffing, until quest.
    Go to quest leader, without harming anyone.
    Descend to each quest level
    (Note:  the quest has been opened; players will simply have to
    refrain from entering lower quest levels until qualified.)
  Go to castle.
    Enter by back door, fall through hole.
  Wander through the valley.  
    Teleport monsters away as needed.
  Waltz through hell harming nothing, sometimes gaining levels
  Use crystal ball as above on vlad-eligible levels, and amnesiate
    Go to bottom regular level.
  Return to level one
